    "updated_at": "2015-11-09T15:12:48Z",
    "body": "@zcorpan thanks for cc me, \n\nI don't think I changed anything but I did move unicode.xml to github in that sort of timeframe, so it's always possible\n\nhttps://github.com/w3c/xml-entities\n\nthe entities for which the semi-colon may be omitted are flagged in unicode.xml with optional-semi attribute eg:\n\n```\n         <entity id=\"QUOT\" set=\"html5-uppercase\" optional-semi=\"yes\">\n\n```\n\nalthough that information was taken from the html spec rather than being the ultimate source of it..\n\nsee also `\"optional-;\"` array in the json form:\n\nhttps://github.com/w3c/xml-entities/blob/gh-pages/2007/htmlmathml.json\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
