    "body": "In case it helps, here’s the list of those references: https://github.com/mathiasbynens/he/blob/master/data/decode-map-legacy.json This was scraped from the spec using the following script: https://github.com/mathiasbynens/he/blob/master/scripts/process-data.js (check `decodeMapLegacy`)\n",
