    "updated_at": "2015-11-09T19:06:37Z",
    "body": "So the problem is that while https://github.com/whatwg/html-build/commit/40aa93092ed3fd269569c3e7f81de04163b07d28 fixed things, since the old stuff was still cached, nothing ended up changing. Ergo, our cache validation logic is broken.\n\nFor now I manually cleared the old cache and now the legacy entities appear just fine.\n",
